shutil.copyfile(T/'SNAPSHOT.md',A/'SNAPSHOT.md')
(K/'ground-truth.md').write_text('''# Hidden fixture chronology (fictional; author-created)\n\nCutoff 2024-09-12 23:59 UTC. Archive received CR-41 at 09:12 and minutes say the chair read it. The order named 27 and an obstructed exit, the board had asked a location clarification and been told to follow the order meanwhile. Temporary relocation can be understood as a precaution; no proof all individuals read or agreed.\n\nThe fieldbook (received Sept 20), city correction (Sept 23), and transmission audit (Sept 24) identify the inspected site as 72 Alder Street, not 27. The board could not have verified this from the supplied cutoff snapshot. Misaddressing contradicts the order's apparent location; it does NOT prove 27 was safe on Sept 12, nor prove negligence. October 4 inspection shows a clear exit only on Oct 4.\n\nThe Oct 18 retrospective memo bears Aug 28 as the subject date but was created and added Oct 18, so it was unavailable at cutoff. The undated-chain carbon bears Sept 10 but archive receipt/access is UNKNOWN; the Oct 10 discovery is not proof it was created then or that nobody had it before. The new poster is unrelated to site identity or exit risk.\n''')
print('archive',len(records),'then',len(pre),'cutoff snapshot hashes',len(manifest))
